OL,3,GNEWSABurst water pipe forces schools to
OL,4,Ashut early
OL,5,
OL,6,FThree schools were forced to send
OL,7,Fpupils home early after a burst water
OL,8,Fpipe left parts of the West Midlands
OL,9,Fwithout water, with some customers
OL,10,Fstill facing disruption on Tuesday
OL,11,Fevening.
OL,13,FRedhill School, Ridgewood High School
OL,14,Fand The Wordsley School all told
OL,15,Fparents they would close on Tuesday
OL,16,Fafternoon as homes and businesses
OL,17,Facross Stourbridge were affected.
OL,19,FSome customers reported having no
OL,20,Fwater, low water pressure or
OL,21,Fdiscoloured supplies, while at least
OL,22,Fone pub was forced to close.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,353,350,200,160,0,100
