OL,3,GNEWSABurst water pipe forces schools to
OL,4,Ashut early
OL,5,
OL,6,FSevern Trent said some supplies were
OL,7,Frestored by 19:00 GMT but warned
OL,8,Frepairs to the damaged pipe were
OL,9,Fcomplex and ongoing.
